74331>>>>>>>                Move (CryptAcquireContextW(AddressOf(hProv),0,pProv,iProvider,CRYPT_NEWKEYSET)) to bOk
74332>>>>>>>            End
74332>>>>>>>>
74332>>>>>>>        End
