75465>>>>>>>    Function SqlServerClientVersionName Integer iClientVersion  Returns String
75467>>>>>>>        
75467>>>>>>>        String  sSqlServerClientVersionName
75467>>>>>>>        
75467>>>>>>>        
75467>>>>>>>        Case Begin
75467>>>>>>>
75467>>>>>>>            Case (iClientVersion = SQLSERVER2019CLIENT)
75469>>>>>>>                Move SQLSERVER2019CLIENTNAME to sSqlServerClientVersionName
75470>>>>>>>                Case Break
75471>>>>>>>            
75471>>>>>>>            Case (iClientVersion = SQLSERVER2017CLIENT)
75474>>>>>>>                Move SQLSERVER2017CLIENTNAME to sSqlServerClientVersionName
75475>>>>>>>                Case Break
75476>>>>>>>                
75476>>>>>>>            Case (iClientVersion = SQLSERVER2016CLIENT)
75479>>>>>>>                Move SQLSERVER2016CLIENTNAME to sSqlServerClientVersionName
75480>>>>>>>                Case Break
