75554>>>>>External_Function WNetGetUserW "WNetGetUserW" MPR.DLL ;    Pointer lpName ;    Pointer lpUser_Name ;    Pointer lpLength ;    Returns DWord
75555>>>>>
75555>>>>>// Wrapper Function WNetGetUser
75555>>>>>Function WNetGetUser Global ;    Pointer lpName ;    Pointer lpUser_Name ;    Pointer lpLength ;    Returns DWord
75557>>>>>    
75557>>>>>    DWord   dwResult     
75557>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75557>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75557>>>>>        
75557>>>>>    Send StringToWide lpName (&uwName)
75558>>>>>    
75558>>>>>    Send WideSetBuffer lpUser_Name lpLength (&uwUserName)    
75559>>>>>    
75559>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (uwName.lpUText, uwUserName.lpUText, lpLength)) to dwResult
75560>>>>>    
