75563>>>>>//    This function reads the current username Of windows and returns that
75563>>>>>//    name or an text unknown user
75563>>>>>Function Network_User_Name for cDesktop Returns String
75565>>>>>    WString wName
75565>>>>>    Integer iRetval iLength
75565>>>>>    
75565>>>>>    Move 0 to iLength
75566>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, 0, AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75567>>>>>    Move (ZeroString(iLength)) to wName
75568>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, AddressOf (wName), AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75569>>>>>    
75569>>>>>    If (iRetval = NO_ERROR) Begin
75571>>>>>        Function_Return (CString (wName))
75572>>>>>    End
75572>>>>>>
75572>>>>>    
75572>>>>>    Function_Return "User Unknown"
75573>>>>>End_Function
