77395>>>>>Class cOrderHeaderDataDictionary is a DataDictionary
77396>>>>>    
77396>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
77398>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
77400>>>>>        
77400>>>>>        Set Main_File to OrderHeader.File_Number
77401>>>>>        
