78063>>>>>>>    Function DFNewPage Integer Columns Returns Integer
78065>>>>>>>        Integer iPageNum
78065>>>>>>>        // This returns a page number used in report object....(this may change)
78065>>>>>>>        Move (WP_CreatePage(Columns)) to iPageNum
78066>>>>>>>        If (iPageNum=0) Begin
