78071>>>>>>>    
78071>>>>>>>    //Return handle to use for winprint dialog. If main_window
78071>>>>>>>    //   exists, use it. Else, get object's handle
78071>>>>>>>    Function Report_Window_Handle Returns Handle
78073>>>>>>>        Handle hWnd
78073>>>>>>>        Handle hoObj
78073>>>>>>>        Get Focus of desktop to hoObj // start with the focus
78074>>>>>>>        Move (gOwnerWindowHandle(hoObj)) to hWnd // global function finds the right handle for us
78075>>>>>>>        Function_Return hWnd
78076>>>>>>>    End_Function
78077>>>>>>>    
