78260>>>>>>>    Procedure DFSetMargins Number nLeft Number nTop Number nRight Number nBottom
78262>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
78262>>>>>>>        Integer iLeft iRight iTop iBottom
78262>>>>>>>        
78262>>>>>>>        Move (nLeft   * 100) to iLeft
78263>>>>>>>        Move (nRight  * 100) to iRight
78264>>>>>>>        Move (nTop    * 100) to iTop
78265>>>>>>>        Move (nBottom * 100) to iBottom
78266>>>>>>>        
78266>>>>>>>        Move (WP_SetMargins(iLeft,iTop,iRight,iBottom)) to bOk
78267>>>>>>>        
78267>>>>>>>        If bOk Begin
78269>>>>>>>            Set DFLeft_Margin   to nLeft
78270>>>>>>>            Set DFTop_Margin    to nTop
78271>>>>>>>            Set DFRight_Margin  to nRight
78272>>>>>>>            Set DFBottom_Margin to nBottom
78273>>>>>>>        End
78273>>>>>>>>
78273>>>>>>>        Else Begin
78274>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_WINPRINT DFPrintError911
78275>>>>>>>>
78275>>>>>>>        End
78275>>>>>>>>
78275>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
78276>>>>>>>    
78276>>>>>>>    
