78279>>>>>>>        Get DFRight_Margin  to nRight
78280>>>>>>>        Get DFBottom_Margin to nBottom
78281>>>>>>>        Send DFSetMargins nLeft nTop nRight nBottom
78282>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
