78769>>>>>>>        Move (nWidth*100)  to iWidth
78770>>>>>>>        Move ((iLength*65536)+iWidth) to iSize
78771>>>>>>>        
78771>>>>>>>        Move (WP_SetUserDefinedPapersize(iSize)) to bOk
78772>>>>>>>        
78772>>>>>>>        If not bOk Begin
78774>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_WINPRINT DFPrintError964
78775>>>>>>>>
78775>>>>>>>        End
78775>>>>>>>>
78775>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
