78839>>>>>>>    
78839>>>>>>>    // internal function, used to extract different printer flags ranges based on
78839>>>>>>>    // the print flag integer. These flags use a decimal style of packing information
78839>>>>>>>    // where different printer options (paper, bin, etc) use different ranges and
78839>>>>>>>    // different steps. Everything above iTopVal is removed and everything that is not
78839>>>>>>>    // within the iStep range is removed.
78839>>>>>>>    Function PrintFlagRange Integer iTopVal Integer iStep Returns Integer
78841>>>>>>>        Integer iFgs iFg
78841>>>>>>>        Get DFGetPrintDialogFlags to iFg
78842>>>>>>>        Move (mod(iFg,iTopVal) / iStep * iStep ) to iFg
78843>>>>>>>        Function_Return iFg
78844>>>>>>>    End_Function
