78911>>>>>    // note that the status can reflect a status from a different report. The winprint object is global.
78911>>>>>    Function DocumentStatus Returns Boolean
78913>>>>>        Integer iStatus
78913>>>>>        Get DocumentStatus of (phoWinprint(Self)) to iStatus
78914>>>>>        Function_Return iStatus
