78929>>>>>    // All subtotal commands use the outer main report. This makes it easier to keep
78929>>>>>    // track of these numbers
78929>>>>>    
78929>>>>>    Procedure Add_SubTotal Integer iCounter Number nData
78931>>>>>        Number nValue
78931>>>>>        Integer iObj
78931>>>>>        Move (RptTotal(Main_Report_Id(Self))) to iObj
78932>>>>>        Get Number_Value of iObj iCounter to nValue
78933>>>>>        Add nData to nValue
78934>>>>>        Set Array_Value of iObj iCounter to nValue
78935>>>>>    End_Procedure
78936>>>>>    
78936>>>>>    Procedure Clr_SubTotal Integer iCounter
78938>>>>>        Set Array_Value of (RptTotal(Main_Report_Id(Self))) iCounter to 0
78939>>>>>    End_Procedure
78940>>>>>    
78940>>>>>    Procedure Clr_AllSubTotals
78942>>>>>        Send Delete_Data of (RptTotal(Main_Report_Id(Self)))
78943>>>>>    End_Procedure
78944>>>>>    
78944>>>>>    Function Sum_SubTotal Integer iTotal Returns Number
78946>>>>>        Number nRetVal
78946>>>>>        Get Number_Value of (RptTotal(Main_Report_Id(Self))) iTotal to nRetVal
78947>>>>>        Function_Return nRetVal
78948>>>>>    End_Function
78949>>>>>    
78949>>>>>    //Return sub-total and clear accumulator
78949>>>>>    //
78949>>>>>    Function SubTotal Integer iTotal Returns Number
78951>>>>>        Number nRetVal
78951>>>>>        Get Sum_SubTotal  iTotal to nRetVal
78952>>>>>        Send Clr_SubTotal iTotal
78953>>>>>        Function_Return nRetVal
78954>>>>>    End_Function
