79078>>>>>    Function Output_Device_Mode Returns Integer
79080>>>>>        Integer hoId
79080>>>>>        String DevMode
79080>>>>>        Get Private.Output_Device_Mode to DevMode
79081>>>>>        If (DevMode=PRINT_TO_UNDEFINED) Begin
79083>>>>>            Get Report_View_Id to hoId
79084>>>>>            If hoID ;                Get OutPut_Device_Mode of hoID to DevMode
79087>>>>>            If (DevMode=PRINT_TO_UNDEFINED) ;                Move PRINT_TO_WINDOW to DevMode
79090>>>>>        End
79090>>>>>>
79090>>>>>        Function_Return DevMode
79091>>>>>    End_Function
79092>>>>>    
79092>>>>>    Procedure Set Output_Device_Mode Integer DevMode
79094>>>>>        Set Private.Output_Device_Mode to DevMode
