79096>>>>>    
79096>>>>>    // displays a metric ruler in .5 increments. This can be
79096>>>>>    // sent to make it easy to see how fields and labels should
79096>>>>>    // be moved for alignment.
79096>>>>>    //
79096>>>>>    Procedure ShowRuler
79098>>>>>        Integer i
79098>>>>>        Number n
79098>>>>>        For i from 0 to 30
79104>>>>>>
79104>>>>>            Send DFWritePos of (phoWinPrint(Self)) (String(i)) FONT_DEFAULT i -1 0
79105>>>>>            Move (i+.5) to n
79106>>>>>            Send DFWritePos of (phoWinPrint(Self)) "." FONT_DEFAULT n -1 0
79107>>>>>        Loop
79108>>>>>>
79108>>>>>        Send DFWriteLn of (phoWinPrint(Self)) ''  FONT_DEFAULT FONT_DEFAULT -1
79109>>>>>    End_Procedure
