79120>>>>>    Procedure Start_Status
79122>>>>>        Integer eMode
79122>>>>>        String sTitle sCaption
79122>>>>>        Get Output_device_mode to eMode
79123>>>>>        If (eMode=PRINT_TO_WINDOW) Begin
79125>>>>>            Get Report_Caption to sCaption
79126>>>>>            Get Report_Title to sTitle
79127>>>>>            If (sTitle<>"" and sCaption<>"") Begin
79129>>>>>                Move ( sCaption- ":" * sTitle) to sTitle
79130>>>>>            End
79130>>>>>>
79130>>>>>            Else Begin
79131>>>>>                Move (sCaption - sTitle) to sTitle
79132>>>>>            End
79132>>>>>>
79132>>>>>            Send SetReportTitle of (phoWinPrint(Self)) sTitle
79133>>>>>        End
79133>>>>>>
79133>>>>>        Else Begin
79134>>>>>            Forward Send Start_status
79136>>>>>        End
79136>>>>>>
