79159>>>>>    Function Report_Interrupt Returns Integer
79161>>>>>        Integer eStat
79161>>>>>        String sMess
79161>>>>>        Boolean bActiveViewer
79161>>>>>        Get IsViewerActive to bActiveViewer
79162>>>>>        If (Error_Check_State(Self)) Begin
79164>>>>>            Move C_$AnErrorWishToCancel to sMess
79165>>>>>        End
79165>>>>>>
79165>>>>>        Else Begin
79166>>>>>            Move  C_$CancelThisReport to sMess
79167>>>>>        End
79167>>>>>>
79167>>>>>        If bActiveViewer Begin
79169>>>>>            Get PreviewYesNoBox of (phoWinPrint(Self)) C_$ReportInterrupt sMess to eStat
79170>>>>>        End
79170>>>>>>
79170>>>>>        Else Begin
79171>>>>>            Move (YesNo_Box(sMess, C_$ReportInterrupt, MB_DEFBUTTON1)) to eStat
79172>>>>>        End
79172>>>>>>
79172>>>>>        
79172>>>>>        Function_Return (eStat=MBR_YES)
79173>>>>>        
79173>>>>>    End_Function
