79174>>>>>    Function Test_KeyPressed Returns Integer
79176>>>>>        Boolean bStop bError bActiveViewer
79176>>>>>        Integer eMode
79176>>>>>        // winreport will do this also, but this makes sure that this gets called
79176>>>>>        // for each body loop -- even if the body loop prints nothing
79176>>>>>        Send PumpMsgQueue of (phoWinPrint(Self)) // permit painting
79177>>>>>        Get IsViewerActive to bActiveViewer
79178>>>>>        Get Output_device_mode to eMode
79179>>>>>        If bActiveViewer Begin
79181>>>>>            Get ViewerWantsToClose of (phoWinPrint(Self)) to bStop
79182>>>>>            Get Error_Check_State to bError
79183>>>>>            If (bStop or bError) Begin
79185>>>>>                Get Report_Interrupt to bStop
79186>>>>>            End
79186>>>>>>
79186>>>>>        End
79186>>>>>>
79186>>>>>        Else Begin
79187>>>>>            Forward Get Test_KeyPressed to bStop
79189>>>>>            If (eMode=PRINT_TO_WINDOW and not(bStop)) Begin
79191>>>>>                Send DfPreviewNoWait
79192>>>>>            End
79192>>>>>>
79192>>>>>        End
79192>>>>>>
79192>>>>>        
79192>>>>>        Function_Return bStop
79193>>>>>    End_Function
